cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. The three authors contributed equally."
title: "Tire fitment explorer"
abstract: >-
  Interactive screening model showing how tire width, rim diameter, tire type,
  tread depth and pressure change stopping distance, slip and other health and
  safety indicators in summer and winter conditions. Built for the Fleet Tire
  Optimization Strategy capstone project at the University of Waterloo.
type: software
authors:
